			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741540801,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，你看，鱼肉是新鲜的，地上也很干净，一定有人刚打扫过。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540802,
					"content": "伯努瓦家一定有人，我们过去听听看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540803,
					"content": "…他说的也有道理，他不能一直消失，至少得偶尔出现一下，散个步什么的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540804,
					"content": "至少能防止邻居报告执律庭，我可不想招来铳枪队。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540805,
					"content": "爸爸，你很想出去散步对吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540806,
					"content": "我…我能吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒鲁瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540807,
					"content": "当然能了，不仅能，我们还很乐意陪你出去散步呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540808,
					"content": "当心点，别反而给他机会出门求救，那两个怪人一直盯着这里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540809,
					"content": "爸爸不会的，我知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540810,
					"content": "爸爸，你会愿意让执律庭知道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540811,
					"content": "知道什么啊…怎么说话这么小声，根本听不清。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540812,
					"content": "他们要出门了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741540813,
					"content": "嗯，我们走远些吧。这次得想办法和伯努瓦说上话，对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540814,
					"content": "没错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741540815,
					"content": "好，我们快走开。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540816,
					"content": "怎么样，爸爸？心情是不是好些了呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540817,
					"content": "是你们！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒鲁瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540818,
					"content": "伯努瓦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540819,
					"content": "…你们救救我，不，别救我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒鲁瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540820,
					"content": "爸爸在说些什么呀，什么救不救的？呵呵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540821,
					"content": "哦，是你们啊，难怪爸爸要特意跟你们打招呼，原来是熟人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540822,
					"content": "…没有，不是的！我们不熟、不熟…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒鲁瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540823,
					"content": "不熟？怎么会呢，我看他们是特地在这里等着你的呀，爸爸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540824,
					"content": "还好心帮我们拿了报纸，还去灰河找了我们以前的邻居史诺德格拉斯聊天。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540825,
					"content": "我想你们应该是很亲近的，爸爸一向很爱孩子，难怪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540826,
					"content": "我也很爱孩子，不过我不像爸爸那么无私，我最爱自己的孩子，可惜她不见了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540827,
						741540829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540827,
					"content": "你们到底在做什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540828
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741540828,
					"content": "我和阿托斯是爸爸的孩子，爸爸爱我们，所以我们也爱爸爸，这不是很明显吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540831,
					"content": "莫蒂西娅，你看今天天气多好啊，适合散步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540832,
					"content": "是的，阿托斯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540833
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540833,
					"content": "今天的蒸汽鸟报你看了吗？有很多非常有趣的新闻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540834,
					"content": "还没有呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540835
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540835,
					"content": "有一条是关于不幸身亡的老年人的，据说他在无人监护的情况下遇到了强盗，因此不慎摔下山崖，跌死了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540836
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540836,
					"content": "是吗？那太凄惨了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540837,
					"content": "还有一条是关于一位不幸溺死的商人的，他好像是酒喝多了，晕晕乎乎地走到了湖里，就这么淹死了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540838,
					"content": "啊，我的天，太不幸了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540839
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540839,
					"content": "#最后一条最有趣，是一位爱多管闲事的老好人，唉，{M#他}{F#她}不小心吃错了药。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540840
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540840,
					"content": "把毒药当成了治病的药，就这么吃了下去，结果死得极其痛苦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540841
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540841,
					"content": "我的天，人的死法可真多，再给我讲讲吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540842
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540842,
					"content": "…对不起，对不起，我不会再这么做了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540843
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒鲁瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540843,
					"content": "爸爸在说什么呢？我们才没有怪你的意思，不过你跑了这一会儿，应该很累了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540844
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540844,
					"content": "阿托斯，我们回去一起读报给爸爸听吧，爸爸不是订了很多报纸吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540845
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540845,
					"content": "是啊，聊得够多了，该回去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540846
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540846,
					"content": "我们回去吧，亲爱的爸爸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540829,
					"content": "你们为什么要这样做？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540830
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741540830,
					"content": "你是指陪爸爸出来散步吗？这是作为子女应尽的义务，否则我怎么对得起爸爸对我的关爱呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西娅"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}